@startuml waterfall_model
!theme plain
title Waste Collection Management System – Waterfall SDLC Model
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
  FontColor #1B5E20
  ArrowColor #1565C0
}

state "1. Requirements Analysis & Specification" as P1 {
  state "• Scenario 23 Elicitation\n• Define Functional (FR-01 to FR-07)\n• Define Non-Functional Requirements\n• Output: IEEE 830 SRS Document" as P1_Desc #FFFFFF
}

state "2. System & Software Design" as P2 {
  state "• 3-Tier System Architecture\n• UML Use Case & Class Diagrams\n• Relational Schema & 3NF Normalization\n• Output: Design Specifications & Diagrams" as P2_Desc #FFFFFF
}

state "3. Implementation (Coding)" as P3 {
  state "• MySQL Database Schema, Views & Seed Data\n• Java 17 Console Application (JDBC / DAO)\n• Python 3 Analytics Pipeline (Pandas / Seaborn)\n• Output: Source Code & Compiled JAR" as P3_Desc #FFFFFF
}

state "4. Integration & Testing" as P4 {
  state "• Unit Testing with JUnit 5 & Mockito (39 Tests)\n• Black Box & White Box System Testing\n• 35 Documented Test Cases (FR Traceability)\n• Output: Test Plan & Test Execution Reports" as P4_Desc #FFFFFF
}

state "5. Deployment & Maintenance" as P5 {
  state "• Automated Launch Scripts (run.bat)\n• Database Setup Scripts & Documentation\n• GitHub Repository Delivery\n• Maintenance (Corrective, Adaptive, Perfective)" as P5_Desc #FFFFFF
}

[*] --> P1
P1 --> P2 : SRS Baselined
P2 --> P3 : Design Approved
P3 --> P4 : Code Compiled & DB Loaded
P4 --> P5 : All Tests Passed (100% Pass)
P5 --> [*]

P4 ..> P3 : Defect Correction
P3 ..> P2 : Design Refinement
P2 ..> P1 : Requirement Clarification

note right of P1
  <b>Deliverable:</b>
  docs/SRS.md
end note

note right of P2
  <b>Deliverables:</b>
  • docs/diagrams/*.puml
  • database/schema.sql
  • database/normalization.md
end note

note right of P3
  <b>Deliverables:</b>
  • java-app/src/
  • python-analysis/
  • database/seed_data.sql
end note

note right of P4
  <b>Deliverables:</b>
  • testing/test_cases.md
  • testing/test_plan.md
  • JUnit test suites
end note

note right of P5
  <b>Deliverables:</b>
  • README.md
  • run.bat / setup-env.ps1
  • GitHub Repository
end note

@enduml
